    "title": "Tedooo",
    "description": "The Tedooo app allows you to connect with millions of crafters, DIY lovers, and potential buyers or sellers directly from your phone.\r\n\r\nBecome a part of amazing social communities, ideal for crafts enthusiasts, with the most innovative social features that let you find exactly what you're looking for creative goods, handmade goods, personalized goods - we have it all! On top of that, the Tedooo app provides you with one of the best craft marketplaces to buy & sell with zero fees. Explore unique items as a user or buy and sell whatever you like on this unique handicraft marketplace.\r\n\r\nWith Tedooo, you can discover all kinds of delightful, personalized, and unique items in one app. We have beautiful collections of handcrafted jewelry, vintage items for your kitchen, customized clothes, DIY packs to let your creativity flow, and so much more.\r\n\r\nFinding what you're looking for is easy with the Tedooo app social features:\r\nAn app that combines a DIY Crafts social community and a social marketplace.\r\nVisit the crafts marketplace to discover handmade products.\r\nA marketplace where you can buy and sell handcrafted items and goods.\r\nonline shop for small businesses where they can sell online with zero fees.\r\nThere are lots of cool crafts marketplace categories and simple navigation.\r\nYou can chat directly with your potential buyer or seller to create the best shopping experience.\r\n\r\n\r\nDownload Tedooo - Socialize, Sell & Buy Crafts.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Tedooo app allows you to connect with millions of crafters, DIY lovers, and potential buyers or sellers directly from your phone.<br><br>Become a part of amazing social communities, ideal for crafts enthusiasts, with the most innovative social features that let you find exactly what you&#39;re looking for creative goods, handmade goods, personalized goods - we have it all! On top of that, the Tedooo app provides you with one of the best craft marketplaces to buy &amp; sell with zero fees. Explore unique items as a user or buy and sell whatever you like on this unique handicraft marketplace.<br><br>With Tedooo, you can discover all kinds of delightful, personalized, and unique items in one app. We have beautiful collections of handcrafted jewelry, vintage items for your kitchen, customized clothes, DIY packs to let your creativity flow, and so much more.<br><br>Finding what you&#39;re looking for is easy with the Tedooo app social features:<br>An app that combines a DIY Crafts social community and a social marketplace.<br>Visit the crafts marketplace to discover handmade products.<br>A marketplace where you can buy and sell handcrafted items and goods.<br>online shop for small businesses where they can sell online with zero fees.<br>There are lots of cool crafts marketplace categories and simple navigation.<br>You can chat directly with your potential buyer or seller to create the best shopping experience.<br><br><br>Download Tedooo - Socialize, Sell &amp; Buy Crafts.",
